    "letter-date": "Date: 7 August 2026",
    "letter-subject": "Exploring a Strategic Partnership in Human Capital Development",
    "letter-salutation": "Dear Sir/Madam",
    "sender-name": "Dr. Patrick Nkhoma",
    "sender-designation": "Managing Director",
    "currentTemplate": "executive",
    "includeSignature": true,
    "letter-body": "<p>On behalf of DALP Consultancy Services, I wish to convey our highest regards and to express our interest in establishing a collaborative relationship with the Embassy of the Federal Republic of Germany.</p>\n<p>For more than twenty years, DALP has been committed to helping students achieve their academic ambitions through professional education counselling, international university admissions, visa processing, and comprehensive study abroad support.</p>\n<p>Our work is guided by strong institutional values of accountability, integrity, transparency, professionalism, reliability, and ethical service delivery, which have earned us the trust of students, parents, and partner institutions over the years.</p>\n<p>DALP also upholds a deep commitment to excellence, student-centred service, and responsible guidance, ensuring that every applicant receives accurate information and fair access to global education opportunities. We take pride in maintaining high standards of due diligence and compliance, particularly in matters relating to international admissions and visa processes.</p>\n<p>Germany's reputation for academic excellence, engineering, scientific research, innovation, and affordable higher education makes it one of the most desirable destinations for ambitious students across Africa. We would be honoured to work alongside the Embassy in promoting educational opportunities available through German universities and related academic programmes.</p>\n<p>Our annual international education events attract students, parents, educators, and institutions from across Zambia, creating an ideal platform to showcase Germany's higher education sector.</p>\n<p>We would appreciate the opportunity to discuss possible areas of cooperation at your convenience.</p>\n<p>Please accept, Your Excellency, the assurances of our highest esteem.</p>",
    "autoPersonalizeSalutation": false,
